description:
Surf the web without tracking with a VPN, shield your devices with Antivirus, & guard your identity with an all-in-one app.


What's new:

* You can now set up and use Alternative ID directly in our app without visiting our website;
* We've refreshed the dedicated IP screen, making it easier to see what you're getting and which country locations are available;
* As always, we added a few bug and performance fixes to keep our app running smoothly.
